Author: AzaharLink contributors

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 11

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: AzaharLink

Summary: Local wireless over the internet through an Azahar room

Description: |
  Tunnels a game's local wireless (UDS) through an Azahar
  multiplayer room, so a real 3DS can play with Azahar
  players and other 3DS consoles over the internet.

  1. Set the room address and your nickname in the menu
  2. Switch on "Connect to room"
  3. Open the game's multiplayer menu as usual

Compatibility: Console

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false # a private mapping is charged to the game's memory budget (FFE then hangs)
